{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9DaGluZXNlLU1vdmllcy9Mb3ZlJTIwTWF0dGVycyUyMCUyODIwMDklMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Love Matters","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/ivrRra3aECwxoZLnQmk7HpmcNiy.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xEFKeVFQHqurtFnyoPMr5oStPla.jpg","description":"\"Love Matters\" is a movie revolving around three main protagonists - 52-year-old Tan Bo Seng, his 17-year-old teenage son Benny and 36-year-old Jeremy, Bo Seng's 'adopted' brother - and their accidental journey in seeking and keeping love and happiness. Bo Seng (Henry Thia) who leads a routine life attempts to revive the passion with his wife Jia Li (Yeo Yann Yann). Jeremy (Jack Lim) lives a colourful life; with \"Never to commit\" as his motto for love. Benny (Alex Leong) has just started school life and his only distraction is his crush, Jennifer (Natalli) who is his classmate's girlfriend.","releaseInfo":"2009","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Others"],"imdbRating":"3.2","runtime":"113 min","cast":["Yeo Yann Yann","Henry Thia","Jack Lim","Cheryl Lee","Lai Meng","Mark Lee","Alex Leong","Mayjune Tan"],"director":["Gilbert Chan","Jack Neo"],"released":"2009-01-22T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Yeo Yann Yann","character":"Jia Li","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ncOxEFlrrR35kVZW5MgA1uGTUMx.jpg"},{"name":"Henry Thia","character":"Tan Bo Seng","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xtHCo2OeRuWRa63ff0svZI5GNRU.jpg"},{"name":"Jack Lim","character":"Jeremy Tan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lkXiQB4M9turPSI1zgnqyGWRUAE.jpg"},{"name":"Cheryl Lee","character":"Miss Wong"},{"name":"Lai Meng","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4YKXPE4t1JjndWY9TY11Hhpjp7V.jpg"},{"name":"Mark Lee","character":"Xiao Han","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9HlO3yUCaW4wClB6245MAamjc4D.jpg"},{"name":"Alex Leong","character":"Benny Tan"},{"name":"Mayjune Tan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hgQIwJ8cZ